- You don't mind giving out the lives?
- No.

525
00:21:01,460 --> 00:21:03,730
Okay, then. Here are ten lives.

526
00:21:04,560 --> 00:21:08,570
(Maillard keeps the deal he made
with Team White and Black a secret.)

527
00:21:08,840 --> 00:21:11,200
We wanted to talk to you about that.

528
00:21:11,200 --> 00:21:13,910
- Your priority is life, right?
- Yes.

529
00:21:13,910 --> 00:21:15,880
First off,

530
00:21:15,880 --> 00:21:17,840
