That's beneficial for us.

532
00:21:19,680 --> 00:21:21,180
- Right.
- That way, we win the vote.

533
00:21:21,180 --> 00:21:23,150
It's 8 against 5,
so we can't lose the vote.

534
00:21:23,150 --> 00:21:24,920
I think it's clear...

535
00:21:24,920 --> 00:21:27,420
