that Maillard has authenticity.)

3789
02:35:49,640 --> 02:35:51,580
In fact, this is nonsense.

3790
02:35:52,010 --> 02:35:55,450
To help Donkey who was branded
as a traitor,

3791
02:35:56,750 --> 02:35:58,520
he bothers to wage a war...

3792
02:35:58,580 --> 02:36:00,520
and gives him the prize money
using diamonds?

3793
02:36:01,190 --> 02:36:03,090
Other people wouldn't understand that.

3794
02:36:03,720 --> 02:36:05,990
I can't do it, no matter what.
Even Donkey can't do it.

3795
02:36:06,530 --> 02:36:08,330
But Maillard can make it.

3796
02:36:08,860 --> 02:36:10,960
And he also said this.

3797
02:36:10,960 --> 02:36:12,930
"I can wage a war and will win it."

3798
02:36:13,770 --> 02:36:17,000
I can trust what he said, actually.

3799
02:36:17,000 --> 02:36:18,200
I hope he'll win.

3800
02:36:18,570 --> 02:36:20,370
But the threat of war disappeared now.

3801
02:36:20,370 --> 02:36:21,640
- Mostly.
- The threat of war disappeared...

3802
02:36:21,640 --> 02:36:24,310
and for the worst case scenario,

3803
02:36:24,310 --> 02:36:25,980
they bond all of a sudden...

3804
02:36:25,980 --> 02:36:28,110
- And stick together again?
- and all of them stick together.

3805
02:36:28,110 --> 02:36:31,420
Then we should try our best to persuade
that person with logic.

3806
02:36:31,520 --> 02:36:34,590
But honestly,
it doesn't worry me that much.

3807
02:36:34,590 --> 02:36:35,850
- Team Red?
- Yes.

3808
02:36:35,990 --> 02:36:38,790
Then we have nothing to give anymore
to Team Red.

3809
02:36:38,790 --> 02:36:41,060
I will go all out...

3810
02:36:41,060 --> 02:36:42,260
to harass Team Gold.

3811
02:36:42,260 --> 02:36:44,960
I wish I could wage a full-scale war...

3812
02:36:45,230 --> 02:36:46,430
against Team Gold.

3813
02:36:50,000 --> 02:36:53,540
(The Community 2: Invisible Hand)

3814
02:37:28,540 --> 02:37:30,340
(The Community 2: Invisible Hand)
